[[Herta]] is a [[henchman]] available in ''[[Guild Wars Nightfall|Nightfall]]'' and ''[[Guild Wars Eye of the North|Eye of the North]]''. She is a member of the [[Order of the Sunspears]].

She is labeled as an "[[Earth Henchman]]."

